{"id":"4f6e59cc4bcadd06","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-certificate-complexity.md","title":"Certificate Complexity","display":"df-certificate-complexity — Certificate Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-certificate-complexity","aliases":["28-df-certificate-complexity"],"display":"df-certificate-complexity — Certificate Complexity","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.3","source_printed_pages":"262","source_pdf_pages":"288","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-certificate-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-certificate-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-certificate-complexity — Certificate Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"262"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"288"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x|_S\">\\(x|_S\\)</span> 为坐标限制。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cert}_f(x,S)\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ [y|_S=x|_S\\Rightarrow f(y)=f(x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cert}_f(x,S)\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ [y|_S=x|_S\\Rightarrow f(y)=f(x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_x(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|S|:S\\subseteq[n],\\ \\operatorname{Cert}_f(x,S)\\},\\qquad C(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}C_x(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_x(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|S|:S\\subseteq[n],\\ \\operatorname{Cert}_f(x,S)\\},\\qquad C(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}C_x(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_b(f)\\coloneqq\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{C_x(f):x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ f(x)=b\\}),\\qquad C(f)=\\max\\{C_0(f),C_1(f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_b(f)\\coloneqq\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{C_x(f):x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ f(x)=b\\}),\\qquad C(f)=\\max\\{C_0(f),C_1(f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>总坐标集总是证书，且取值范围有限，所以所有最小值和最大值达到。常函数的空证书给 C=0；不存在 b 实例时令 C_b=0。原书 Definition 12.3 将坐标证书写成 {0,1}^n 的子集，按其 x|S 用法应为 [n] 的子集，本节点修正此明显类型笔误。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.3，印刷页 262，PDF 页 288。已比对陈述。未声称完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"x|_S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cert}_f(x,S)\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ [y|_S=x|_S\\Rightarrow f(y)=f(x)].","display":true},{"tex":"C_x(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|S|:S\\subseteq[n],\\ \\operatorname{Cert}_f(x,S)\\},\\qquad C(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}C_x(f).","display":true},{"tex":"C_b(f)\\coloneqq\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{C_x(f):x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ f(x)=b\\}),\\qquad C(f)=\\max\\{C_0(f),C_1(f)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1442,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第12章：决策树与证书：[[28-df-decision-tree]]、[[28-df-certificate-complexity]]、[[28-thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound]]。"},{"id":"233f52378190a961","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]。"},{"id":"12ca2ea9396c7639","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}